plot2 mailing list.<br>Please provide a reproducible example: <a href=\"http://gist.github.com/270442\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://gist.github.com/270442&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792378234812000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3e-U3VHgYyanyP5M5FDCVQ\">http://gist.github.com/270442</a><br> <br>To post: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>To unsubscribe: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a><br>More options: <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792378234812000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2bWSX6STNO-Zcb_PpNaOpp\">http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2</a></span><u></u><u></u></p></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br><br clear=\"all\"><u></u><u></u></p><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">-- <br>- <br>******************************************************************************<br>James McCreight                               <br>cell: <a href=\"tel:(831)%20261-5149\" value=\"+18312615149\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(831) 261-5149</a><br>VoIP (to cell): <a href=\"tel:(720)%20897-7546\" value=\"+17208977546\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(720) 897-7546</a><u></u><u></u></p></div></div></div>"
